.THS Distributions 5L News.SH NAMEDistributions - a list of default distributions for given groups..SH DESCRIPTION.ti +3If no.B Distribution:field is given in the header mnews try to determinate a defaultdistribution form this file..SH FORMATThe format of the file is.ce<newsgroup> <distribution>{ <comment>}where.B <newsgroups>is a newsgroup in regular expression format. If this matches thenewsgroup in the header, then the distribution.B <distribution>is used. The comment is currently not used but can contain someexplanation about each distribution..SH EXAMPLE.raw 4^muc\\..*   muc^sub\\..*   sub^rec\\..*   world.noraw